  \\phantom{0}205,\\!837 \\\\\n   + 625,\\!787 \\\\\n   \\hline\n     831,\\!624 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{831,\\!624}\n\\].Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
