*\n   \\[\n   7 + 8 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 16 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 6 \\text{ and carry over } 1)\n   \\]\n   \n6. **Add the hundred thousands place:**\n   \\[\n   6 + 9 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 16 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 6 \\text{ and carry over } 1)\n   \\]\n   \n7. **Add the carried over million place:**\n   \\[\n   1\n   \\]\n   \n**Final Sum:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!661,\\!368}\n\\].Therefore, my final answer is: ']]
