to add, write down the carried over **1**.\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**.\n\n   \\[.\n   \\begin{array}{r}.\n     \\phantom{0}508,066 \\\\.\n   + \\phantom{0}707,488 \\\\.\n   \\hline.Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
